  "scope": "STANDARD",
  "finalDifficulty": 0,
  "shortDescription": "Within the last three months, {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.Name} has struck our facilities, personnel, and supply convoys over half a dozen times. My superiors in the {TEAM_EMP.FactionDef.Government} leadership would like to even the score. We'd like to hire you to find a {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.Demonym} lance and destroy it, to demonstrate we are not without military resources on {TGT_SYSTEM.Name}.<b><color=#e20000>[WARNING: Zombies]</color></b>",
  "longDescription": "If they want to show military strength here in {TGT_SYSTEM.Name}, we can do that for them.",
  "salvagePotential": 12,
